  "question": "What\u2019s the closest caf\u00e9 you pass going from Hamtramck Disneyland, Hamtramck, MI to TYP Collection, Birmingham, MI?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.058623 42.407216)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.213824 42.545655)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'cafe'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.058623 42.407216)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.058623 42.407216)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
